-- The definition is open ("bao gồm nhưng không bị giới hạn", including but not limited to):
-- any use or threat of force by one person or a group, for a political, religious or
-- ideological end "or similar purposes". Whether an act was terrorism is an input; nothing
-- below can decide it (finding 6).
