-- Two burden clauses. The first, inside A3(c), is triggered when the Insurer "considers"
-- ("cho là") that A3(c) applies, with no proceedings needed; the second, after A3(e), when
-- in any action the Insurer alleges ("cho rằng") that A3(a), (b) or (c) applies. Either way
-- the Insured must prove the loss is covered. For every other exclusion, and for an A3
-- allegation outside proceedings other than under (c), the wording says nothing (finding 6).
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion A3, src:147-150 and 168-171
GIVEN `the Insurer relies on A3(a), (b) or (c) in an action or proceeding` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Insurer considers that A3(c) applies`                          IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A bearer of the burden of proof`
`who must prove that the loss is covered, under Exclusion A3, where` `the Insurer relies on A3(a), (b) or (c) in an action or proceeding` `and where` `the Insurer considers that A3(c) applies` MEANS
    IF   `the Insurer relies on A3(a), (b) or (c) in an action or proceeding` OR `the Insurer considers that A3(c) applies`
    THEN `the Insured bears it`
    ELSE `the wording does not say who must prove that a loss is covered, outside the two burden clauses of Exclusion A3`

@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion A3, src:147-150 and 168-171
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the wording does not say who must prove that a loss is covered, outside the two burden clauses of Exclusion A3` MEANS
    REFUSE "the wording does not say who must prove that a loss is covered, outside the two burden clauses of Exclusion A3"

-- src:152 | Trong trường hợp bất kì phần nào của điều khoản loại trừ này không có giá trị hay không
-- src:153 | thực hiện được thì những phần còn lại vẫn giữ nguyên hiệu lực và có giá trị áp dụng.
