        `the piece` `is of a kind in` `the kinds in B1(a)`
    AND NOT (    `the piece`'s `specially stated in the Policy as insured`
             AND `the chain of` `the piece` `includes one of` `the perils the carve-back to B1 names`)

@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B1(b)-(d), src:195-207
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
