`exclusion B1(b)-(d) applies to` `the piece` MEANS
        `the piece` `is of a kind in` `the kinds in B1(b), (c) and (d)`
    AND NOT ("but this Policy shall not exclude Loss caused by" ... `the chain of` `the piece` `includes one of` `the perils the carve-back to B1 names`)

