GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion B3(f) applies to` `the piece` MEANS
    `the chain of` `the piece` `includes one of` (LIST `a process the property was undergoing`)

-- (g) machinery or equipment, "if directly attributable" to the installation, moving or
-- relocation: the operation must be the direct cause. Machinery or equipment is read to
-- include electronic equipment and pressure apparatus, which are machinery or equipment too.
GIVETH A LIST OF `A kind of property`
`machinery and equipment, for Exclusion B3(g)` MEANS
    LIST `machinery or equipment`, `electronic systems, computers or data processing equipment`,
         `a boiler, economiser, turbine, or other vessel, machinery or apparatus in which pressure is used, or its contents`

@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B3(g), src:231-232
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion B3(g) applies to` `the piece` MEANS
        `the piece` `is of a kind in` `machinery and equipment, for Exclusion B3(g)`
    AND `the piece`'s `the direct cause` EQUALS `installation, moving or relocation of machinery or equipment, including dismantling and re-erection`

-- (h) property being worked on, with the subsequent-Loss exception.
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B3(h), src:234-238
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion B3(h) applies to` `the piece` MEANS
        `the chain of` `the piece` `includes one of` (LIST `work on the property: refurbishing, repair, testing, installation or servicing`)
    AND NOT `exception (i), subsequent Loss from a cause not excluded, holds for` `the piece`

-- (i) "tài sản đã được bảo hiểm riêng dưới đơn bảo hiểm riêng biệt khác": property insured
-- separately under another, separate policy is excluded outright. Exclusion B4 and General
-- Condition 6 treat other insurance quite differently (fork F13, finding 2).
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B3(i), src:240; fork F13
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion B3(i) applies to` `the piece` MEANS
    `the piece` `was` `insured separately under another, separate policy`

