-- src:242 | 4. Tổn thất đối với tài sản mà tại thời điểm xảy ra Tổn thất tài sản đó được bảo hiểm hoặc đáng lẽ
-- src:243 | được bảo hiểm bởi các đơn bảo hiểm khác, nhưng do có sự tồn tại của điều khoản mở rộng này
-- src:244 | sẽ loại trừ phần thiệt hại vượt quá số tiền lẽ ra có thể được được bồi thường dưới các đơn bảo
-- src:245 | hiểm đó mà Hợp đồng bảo hiểm bảo hiểm này chưa có hiệu lực.
-- The sentence is garbled. Read word for word it says the Policy does not cover loss to such
-- property and, "by reason of this extension clause", EXCLUDES the part of the loss above
-- what the other policies would have paid: which would leave nothing covered at all, and
-- makes the "nhưng" (but) idle. Fork F12 takes the reading that gives "nhưng" its work: the
-- Policy covers only the EXCESS over what the other policies would have paid had this Policy
-- not been in force. Applied per item, before the Under-insurance condition (fork F17).
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B4, src:242-245; fork F12
GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the other insurance` IS AN `Other insurance of the property`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`exclusion B4: the part of` `the amount` `this Policy bears, given` `the other insurance` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the other insurance`
    WHEN `no other insurance` THEN `the amount`
    WHEN `insured by other policies in force at the time of the Loss` `what they would have paid` THEN
        max 0 (`the amount` MINUS `what they would have paid`)
    WHEN `not insured elsewhere, but it would have been, were it not for this Policy` `what they would have paid` THEN
        max 0 (`the amount` MINUS `what they would have paid`)

§§ `B5: boilers and pressure apparatus, by their explosion or rupture`

-- src:247 | 5. Tổn thất đối với nồi hơi, các thiết bị tiết kiệm, tuốc bin hoặc các loại bình chứa, máy móc hoặc
-- src:248 | thiết bị sử dụng áp lực hay các chất liệu chứa bên trong các thiết bị này do việc nổ hay đứt gãy
-- src:249 | các thiết bị trên.
-- "do việc nổ hay đứt gãy các thiết bị trên": by explosion or rupture of "the above
-- apparatus". Fork F11: read as the class, so a boiler wrecked by another boiler's explosion
-- is excluded too.
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B5, src:247-249; fork F11
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion B5 applies to` `the piece` MEANS
        `the piece` `is of a kind in` (LIST `a boiler, economiser, turbine, or other vessel, machinery or apparatus in which pressure is used, or its contents`)
    AND `the chain of` `the piece` `includes one of` (LIST `explosion or rupture of a boiler, economiser, turbine, or other vessel, machinery or apparatus in which pressure is used`)

§§ `Section B as a whole`

@ref UIC PAR, Exclusion B, src:183-249
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A LIST OF PAIR OF STRING, BOOLEAN
`the limbs of section B, applied to` `the piece` MEANS
    LIST (PAIR OF "B1(a)",     `exclusion B1(a) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B1(b)-(d)", `exclusion B1(b)-(d) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B2",        `exclusion B2 applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(a)",     `exclusion B3(a) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(b)",     `exclusion B3(b) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(c)",     `exclusion B3(c) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(d)",     `exclusion B3(d) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(e)",     `exclusion B3(e) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(f)",     `exclusion B3(f) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(g)",     `exclusion B3(g) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(h)",     `exclusion B3(h) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B3(i)",     `exclusion B3(i) applies to` `the piece`),
         (PAIR OF "B5",        `exclusion B5 applies to` `the piece`)

§ `The exclusions together`

-- Which exclusions apply to a piece of property, by label. B4 is not on the list: it does
-- not exclude property, it reduces the amount (see above).
@ref UIC PAR, Exclusions A and B, src:35-249
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`the exclusions that apply to` `the piece` MEANS
    mapMaybe (GIVEN `the limb` YIELD IF `the limb`'s snd THEN JUST (`the limb`'s fst) ELSE NOTHING)
             (append (`the limbs of section A, applied to` `the piece`) (`the limbs of section B, applied to` `the piece`))

@ref UIC PAR, Exclusions A and B, src:35-249
GIVEN `the piece` IS A `A piece of property lost or damaged`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`an exclusion applies to` `the piece` MEANS
    any (GIVEN `the limb` YIELD `the limb`'s snd)
        (append (`the limbs of section A, applied to` `the piece`) (`the limbs of section B, applied to` `the piece`))
